 the classic Mahjong game\n\nWhether you are a mahjong master or a beginner, this game will be your best choice!\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels, and simple game rules, suitable for everyone!\nIt\u2019s transformed from the traditional matching game and brings a relaxing experience to players in a 3D way.\nBe the master and pair all the cubes to eliminate them on over 30 levels!\n\nGame features:\n\n- 60 levels\n- Mixed reality support\n- 5 Relaxing environment with daytime and night mode, plus a random option.\n- 8 Tile set\n- Classic and 3D style levels.\n- English, Hungarian and Simplified Chinese languages.\n- Rotate, move and zoom the board.\n\n\n{808240775651188}", "short_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels and simple game rules!\n5 relaxing environments, 8 various colourful tile sets,60 levels and night mode! Mixed Reality support"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo2-chinese.png", "id": "1628457724592817", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75568725_1628457727926150_374747833840138475_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L-xoSf19AYgQ7kNvwGa_31s&_nc_oc=AdoyAc7sQ4OZhxj9V8FZOSdDEvZr0KszRtYWHxNZDglY4jkaH1lMP736soznz7IWc0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3e3PM1-4E9i3Bt9qLPwK5qnO2zSSnby3E6CTklwTe7Hw&oe=69F1F8C0"}, {"file_name": "landscapefull-chinese.png", "id": "1452552865375930", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210891_1452552868709263_7671164401111142330_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v2Q7YMXY6zAQ7kNvwFC7tBk&_nc_oc=AdrXzDQB5hWT6mHYDprzFWQP_WzcCzEVe9slvLc0w1ejGnHp5dbYv64W0rrmmDZDS7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2LLIknhNMBjz4EsSdMmLDjWWBYKQIshoh7rhx0CoSPLQ&oe=69F1E96B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "1151590899619147", "image_type": "APP_